# ── Annual variant IDs (test mode) ──
# You have no test-mode annual variants. Leaving these blank is INTENTIONAL and
# safe: with no annual variant AND no live checkout URLs below, an annual
# purchase attempt fails with "checkout is not configured" instead of silently
# falling through to your LIVE checkout link and taking real money mid-test.
# Create annual variants in LS test mode if you want to test the annual path.
